    "meaning": "at (someone's place or company); near; during, with",
    "shortDefinition": "Where someone is staying, working or near."
  },
  "intro": {
    "title": "At my place",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Bei has no single English match. It means 'at someone's place' (bei mir), 'at a company' (bei Siemens), 'at the doctor's' (beim Arzt) and 'near' (bei Berlin). It always takes the dative."
    ]
  },
